# [DD-13b.W23.1] A COLUMN-1 `#` BETWEEN TWO PROSE LINES OF A REGION, and
# it is the SHARPER of the pair with comment_in_config_body.rxtin.
#
# Under the transparent reading this file produces an opener carrying TWO
# DISJOINT PROSE REGIONS — a shape S3's single-extent rule cannot express
# at all. A shape the specification cannot describe needs a fixture, not a
# sentence. The comment ends the region, the line below it continues
# nothing, and the refusal names THAT line.
description |
  first prose line
# a column-one comment
  this line continues nothing

pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
